          "summary": "<p>财新网08月20日电：沪指开盘报3907.21点，涨幅0.33%。</p><p>深成指报14032.97点，涨幅1.03%；创业板指报3517.65点，涨幅1.27%；中小板指报8589.90点，涨幅0.79%。</p><p>盘面上，医药生物领涨，有色金属、汽车、美容护理、电子、传媒等板块涨幅居前，煤炭领跌，银行、石油石化、农林牧渔、食品饮料、公用事业等走弱。</p><p>消息面上，美国财政部出手护盘，美债收益率走低，金银拉升；央行连续三个月动用隔夜逆回购，8月操作有何不同；宇树科技一日造富，创始人、员工、投资人账面盈利丰厚；全民医疗保障“十五五”规划发布；美联储纪要显示鹰派情绪更浓，沃什提及减少会议次数至每年6次；长江存储完成IPO辅导验收，上市估值预期拉高。</p><p>撰写：财小智   责编：财小新</p><div class=\"yqzszb\" id=\"yqzszb\"><div class=\"header\"><div class=\"yqzszb-title\"><strong><span>上市公司敏感舆情指数</span></strong><img alt=\"数据+\" class=\"support\" src=\"https://entities.caixin.com/support.png\" /></div><p><em class=\"update-time\">更新时间：2026-08-20</em></p></div><div class=\"yqzszb-list\"><div class=\"list-header\"><div class=\"order\">排名</div><div class=\"others\"><div class=\"stock\">股票</div><div class=\"index\">今日指数</div><div class=\"comp\">较昨日</div></div></div><ul class=\"yqzszb-lists\"><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001247\"><div class=\"row-order\">1</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001247\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">ST三木<p><span class=\"stock-no\">000632.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">10.28</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+10.28</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">ST三木：7700万元借款纠纷达成调解，6.81亿元合同纠纷撤销一审判决驳回起诉</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101015253\"><div class=\"row-order\">2</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101015253\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">金麒麟<p><span class=\"stock-no\">603586.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">8.45</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+8.45</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">兴证资管金麒麟兴享优选混合C净值下跌8.20%</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/10100628